{"unit_id":"Da1dr1em__dsh-ego-browser#card-zh","repo":"Da1dr1em/dsh-ego-browser","commit":"25ab028307072e2745fbab3764b234aa893a71c5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ego-browser 是一个面向 DSH 的本机浏览器自动化插件，通过 host 侧工具把 JavaScript 脚本交给 ego-browser CLI，在真实 Edge 或 Chrome 中完成网页任务。它提供脚本执行、按主题查阅 API 指南和浏览器宿主状态检查，可在一次调用中导航、交互、等待并提取页面信息，也支持跨调用保留任务空间和登录态。适合需要让 DSH agent 搜索网页、操作页面或处理已登录会话的用户。运行需要本机可用的 ego-browser 命令及兼容的浏览器；浏览器任务使用本机宿主环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:73-109","src/tools.ts:50-141"]}
{"unit_id":"Da1dr1em__dsh-ego-browser#card-en","repo":"Da1dr1em/dsh-ego-browser","commit":"25ab028307072e2745fbab3764b234aa893a71c5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ego-browser adds browser tools to DSH. It runs JavaScript tasks in Edge or Chrome through the ego-browser CLI, and offers API guidance and host status checks. Agents can navigate, interact, and extract results; task spaces persist across calls. A local CLI and browser are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:73-109","src/tools.ts:50-141"]}
